														</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="664528" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="664528" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ii1ctk" class="scraped-container el-664528 prdct_faq"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="scraped-container-box cbox-664528-0"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="645984" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="645984" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="it45pi" class="faq el-645984"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i5zu5f" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iv2s5j" class="faq-title">The Science Behind PrimeCell H2
												  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
													</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ihegrj" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="835113" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="835113" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-835113"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ivplpp" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="i3kyez">If you're feeling drained, foggy, or like your body isn't bouncing back the way it used to — oxidative stress could be playing a role.
														  </p><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i7wwit">Oxidative stress is a natural part of how your body responds to daily life — but as we age, our natural antioxidant defenses can use extra support to keep up.
															</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i68qcu">Most antioxidants work on the surface. They can't easily reach the places in your body where cellular activity is happening — deep within your cells, your tissues, and your hardest-working systems.
															</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ickp7k">And many traditional antioxidants work indiscriminately, neutralizing both harmful and beneficial free radicals your body uses for everyday function.
															</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i19rlp">PrimeCell H2 delivers molecular hydrogen — one of the smallest molecules in nature — to support your body's natural antioxidant defenses. Its small size allows it to reach areas larger antioxidants can't, and it works selectively to support balanced antioxidant activity.
															</div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="ikpu6f">It's a smarter foundation for the supplement routine you've already built.
															</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="999800" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="999800" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="iq6ote" class="faq el-999800"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="imrmfh" class="faq-header"><div data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="in06u8" class="faq-title">Daily Benefits of PrimeCell H2
												  </div><svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 15 15" height="15" width="15" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" href="" class="faq-icon"><path xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M12.0581 4.55812L12.9419 5.44187L7.50001 10.8837L2.05814 5.44187L2.94189 4.55812L7.50001 9.11625L12.0581 4.55812Z" fill="currentColor" href="">
													</path></svg></div><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="faq-content-wrapper"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="io9cvk" class="faq-content"><div data-v-8eb46620="" data-eid="340616" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="element-wrapper"><div data-v-8eb46620="" id="340616" href="" data-secondsdelay="" class="paragraph el-340616"><div href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ih5dm2" class="paragraph-inner"><p data-text="text" href="" data-secondsdelay="" id="ior5em"><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">1. Steady Daily Energy
															</b></p><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="i0e0vg">Molecular hydrogen supports your body's natural energy production at the cellular level — helping you feel steady and consistent throughout the day, without caffeine or stimulants.*
														  </div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="" id="iwo12i">2. Healthy Aging Support
															</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">PrimeCell H2 supports your body's natural antioxidant defenses, helping you feel and look your best as part of a healthy lifestyle.*
														  </div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">3. Active Lifestyle Support
															</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Daily activity creates oxidative stress your body naturally works to manage. PrimeCell H2 supports your body's natural antioxidant balance — helping you stay active and consistent.*
														  </div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">4. Mental Performance
															</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Molecular hydrogen is one of the smallest antioxidants in nature. It supports your body's natural antioxidant defenses to help you stay sharp and engaged in your daily activities.*
														  </div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">5. Antioxidant Defense
															</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Everyday life produces oxidative stress. PrimeCell H2 supports your body's natural antioxidant systems — helping maintain balance from the inside out.*
														  </div><div data-secondsdelay=""><br data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay=""><b data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">6. Cellular Wellness
															</b></div><div data-text="text" data-secondsdelay="">Your body's cells work hard every day. PrimeCell H2 supports healthy cellular function and your body's natural antioxidant defenses — supporting overall wellness as part of a healthy routine.*
